// Title: JXA In-memory Execution Via OSAScript
// ID: f1408a58-0e94-4165-b80a-da9f96cf6fc3
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
// Date: 2023-01-31
// Tags: attack.t1059.002, attack.t1059.007, attack.execution
// Description: Detects possible malicious execution of JXA in-memory via OSAScript
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((src.process.cmdline containsCIS " -l " AND src.process.cmdline containsCIS "JavaScript")) OR (src.process.cmdline containsCIS ".js")) AND ((src.process.cmdline containsCIS "osascript" AND src.process.cmdline containsCIS " -e " AND src.process.cmdline containsCIS "eval" AND src.process.cmdline containsCIS "NSData.dataWithContentsOfURL")))
